src/bot.ts and src/server.ts are based on the Discord channel
plugin for Claude Code ("claude-channel-discord", from the
anthropics/claude-plugins-official repository), Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The access control (pairing,
allowlists, access.json), message gating, permission relay and the reply /
react / edit_message / download_attachment / fetch_messages tools come from
that plugin. This project split it into a standalone bot (bot.ts) and a
small MCP bridge (server.ts), and added slash commands, the Arknights tools,
music, voice lines, API model backends and an add-on module system (with the
optional roleplay module in modules/roleplay).
The original files carried no per-file license headers.

